+    more than one taper -- ``plv``, ``ciplv``, ``ppc``, ``pli``, ``dpli``,
+    ``wpli`` and ``wpli2_debiased`` at NW 3. MNE sums each epoch's tapers into
+    one cross-spectrum before the phase non-linearity; this package treats
